"900.3.10(1049)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 1049 sets site-specific rules: lot frontage and area as they existed in 2013, a 3.0 m setback from street lot lines, a 6.0 m maximum setback from Middlefield Rd., a 1.0 m side setback on one side, 50 percent coverage, a 6.0 m setback for parking entrances, parking in a building, and compliance with exception 1462.","code_refs":"none"},
