"900.3.10(377)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 377 keeps lot frontage and area as they existed in 2013, sets side setbacks of 1.2 m and 5.7 m on a street, requires parking in the residential building and a 0.3 m garage side setback.","code_refs":"none"}
